# Copy to .env (and add the same variables in your host, e.g. Vercel →
# Project → Settings → Environment Variables), then rebuild/redeploy.
#
# Where the Contact enquiry form and the Josoorkom dialog are sent
# (see src/lib/form-endpoint.ts). Set ONE of these:

# Web3Forms access key (https://web3forms.com → "Create Access Key").
# Submissions are emailed to the address the key was created for.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=

# …or any other endpoint that accepts a FormData POST (Formspree, Getform,
# a serverless function…). Takes priority if both are set.
PUBLIC_FORM_ENDPOINT=

# With neither set, the enquiry form opens the visitor's email app addressed
# to info@gulfasco.com with every field filled in, and the Josoorkom dialog
# continues to the platform without storing the visitor's details.
